sequenceDiagram
    participant Student
    participant FE as React frontend
    participant API as Express web server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    loop While the student is drafting
        Student->>FE: 1. Type question title and body
        Note right of FE: #160;2. Wait for typing pause#160;
        FE->>API: 3. GET /api/v1/courses/{id}/posts?q=draft
        Note right of API: #160;4. Validate session and membership#160;
        API->>DB: 5. Ranked full-text search in course
        DB-->>API: 6. Matching posts
        API-->>FE: 7. 200 OK with related posts
        FE-->>Student: 8. Show related questions
    end

    alt Existing post answers the question
        Student->>FE: 9. Open related post
        Note over Student,FE: #160;No new post is created#160;
    else Student still needs to ask
        Student->>FE: 10. Submit question
        FE->>API: 11. POST /api/v1/courses/{id}/posts
        Note right of API: #160;12. Validate session, CSRF,#160;<br/>#160;role, course not archived#160;
        API->>DB: 13. Insert post and search vector (one transaction)
        DB-->>API: 14. New post row
        API-->>FE: 15. 201 Created
        FE-->>Student: 16. Show new question
    end
